{"about_the_game":"<i>You wake up on an unknown island, alone and without help. Will you be able to solve the mysteries it contains? Will you find out how you got there? Could you escape from <strong>The Island</strong>?</i><br><br><strong>The Island</strong> is an Escape Room where you have to make your way through intelligence and lateral thinking. You will solve a huge number of puzzles while discovering an interesting story and moving through the corners of an island full of challenges. Search for clues, find objects and secrets and keep a cool head, because only then you will be able to get out alive from The Island.<br><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of puzzles that will challenge your mind<br></li><li>Large island with different atmospheres<br></li><li>A story that will keep you hooked<br></li><li>From escape room lovers to escape room lovers</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819730?t=1761162505","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819730/c3d5c3a6ed4306b8940b1a5654c56784116f55e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761162505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819730/deb36f6e8a212eb22a98e4d8980d7db92725fb88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761162505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819730/deb36f6e8a212eb22a98e4d8980d7db92725fb88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761162505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full"